  "marks": 3,
  "stem": "質量 0.50 kg 的鋁塊，溫度由 20.0 °C 升至 80.0 °C，吸收了 2.70 × 10^4 J 的熱。求鋁的比熱容量。",
  "answer": {
    "value": 900,
    "tolerance": 0.02,
    "unit": "J kg^-1 °C^-1"
  },
  "workedSolution": [
    "ΔT = 80.0 − 20.0 = 60.0 °C",
    "c = Q / (m ΔT)",
    "c = 2.70 × 10^4 / (0.50 × 60.0) = 9.00 × 10^2 J kg^-1 °C^-1"
  ],
